# LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every platform. Without this a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF files, which the MDL->XMILE
# writer copies into <doc> text (breaking byte-identity goldens) and which make
# every touched file show as fully rewritten. Binary files are auto-detected.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored real-world model corpus driven by the corpus tests. Mark it so
# GitHub collapses these files in diffs and leaves them out of the language
# statistics; the models are third-party inputs, not code we author. -text keeps
# them byte-identical to their sources: several are CRLF or mixed on purpose
# (real Vensim/Stella exports), and git must not convert them either way.
test/fixtures/** linguist-generated=true linguist-vendored=true -text
